                "loc": "PSA.142"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amalu 142",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davidi afumine ku Gati no kufyukila ku lucengo lwa Adulamu. Ilyo bamunyina pamo na ba mu ŋanda ya bantu bonse bakwa wishi baumfwile pali ifi fintu, balimukonkele kulya kwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonse abantu abakwete ubulanda, nangu abakwete nkongole nangu abali ne cikonko, baya longana apo ali. Elyo nao aba intungulushi yabo. Nalimo bali imyanda ine (400) abali nankwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukufuma kulya Davidi aile ku musumba wa ku Misipa mu Moabu no kuya eba imfumu ya ku Moabu ati, “Bushe teti muleke batata na bamayo bese no kwikala na imwe mpaka nkeshibe ifyo Lesa afwaya ukuncitila?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi epakubasha ku mfumu ya mu Moabu, eko bashala baleikala pa nshiku shonse Davidi ali mwilinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo kasesema Gadi atile kuli Davidi, “Wiyikala mwilinga, kabiyefye mu calo cakwa Yuda.” Elyo Davidi afuma aya na ku mutengo wa Hereti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba Saulo alyumfwile ukuti Davidi na bantu bakwe nababasanga. Kabili Saulo ninshi ali ne fumo mu minwe yakwe naikala mwisamba lya cimuti ca Tamarisiki pa lupili lwa Gibea, na bacilolo bakwe bonse nabeminina ukumushinguluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Saulo aeba bacilolo bakwe ati, “Umfweni, mwe baume bakwa Benjamini! Bushe mwana Yese akamupeela imwe bonse amabala elyo ne myangashi? Bushe bonse imwe akamucita ukuba abakalamba ba fita pa makana elyo na pa myanda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe ifi fine e fintu filengele imwe mumfwane mukunsangukila? Pantu takwaba nangu umo uwanjeba ilyo umwana wandi acita icipangano no mwana wakwa Yese. Pali imwe, tapali nangu umo uwasakamene ukunjeba ati umwana wandi eutunkile umubomfi wandi ukundalilila, ngefyo cili mu bushiku bwa lelo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
